    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I guess I'm just wondering if it's actually a sustainable long-term strategy though. Most experts seem to say that these moves just end up causing more harm than good in the end. Is there any actual evidence that this kind of approach works for a global economy, or is it just short-term political gain?",
